---

## WHY THIS EXISTS

Earned from real failures and near-misses: Discovery silently empty from calibration bugs, LIVE badges on fabricated data, sample standing in for the moat feature, execution diagrams that dropped the approval gate, "9.7/10" self-scores with no ground truth, and autonomy-pressure loops that could erode capital-gating. This rule keeps those mistakes from recurring under a new feature name.
